message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Neural Network Solver for 2nd-Order Differential Equations (TensorFlow Implementation)"
abstract: >-
  The original TensorFlow 2 implementation of a general-purpose physics-informed
  neural network (PINN) solver for 2nd-order ordinary and partial differential
  equations, demonstrated on a damped harmonic oscillator and the 1D heat equation.
  The network is trained without any labelled solution data, purely by minimizing
  the differential equation's residual together with its initial and boundary
  conditions. Establishes the extensible DEProblem interface pattern reused across
  all later PINN projects in this portfolio.
